  faq=[('Can you drive up Mont Ventoux in winter?','Not to the summit: the road closes around mid-November and reopens in spring. You can drive up to Chalet Reynard or Mont Serein.'),('How high is Mont Ventoux?','1,910 metres.'),('What is the hardest climb up Ventoux?','The one from Bédoin: 21.8 km at an average gradient of 7.5%, with steeper sections.')],
